     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: cwilper<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=189298<br/>\nOriginator: NO</p>\n\n<p>The included self-signed certificate is just a <br/>\nconvenience for getting people up and running quickly.  <br/>\nCerts from established authorities should be obtained <br/>\nby the individual organizations installing/using Fedora, <br/>\nif desired.</p>",
